This IS now an apples-to-apples comparison — heuristic ran through the
identical sequential demand stream + jamming/intercept-resend as PPO/DQN,
not Phase 0's static attack-free batch. If PPO/DQN beat the heuristic here,
that's the actual claim worth making; if they're close to or worse than it,
that's equally important to know before writing this up anywhere.
